# What dawos-audio-test does today without a graph: the tone that comes
# back through the cable on input 3 goes to output 5, as it is, and
# comes back on input 5 inside the interface.
#
# One chain, all of it on the thread that holds the sound card.

input   in3    channel=3
output  out5   channel=5
connect in3 -> out5
